    <string name="health_atlas_home_glucagon_story_title">胰高血糖素怎样让肝脏释放葡萄糖</string>
    <string name="health_atlas_home_glucagon_story_scope">只演示肝糖原分解相关路径，不显示血糖阈值、调节速度或个人血糖。</string>
    <string name="health_atlas_home_glucagon_story_signal">血糖下降，α 细胞响应</string>
    <string name="health_atlas_home_glucagon_story_signal_caption">当血糖下降时，胰岛 α 细胞可增加胰高血糖素分泌。胰岛中的其他细胞也参与调节。</string>
    <string name="health_atlas_home_glucagon_story_release">胰高血糖素进入血液</string>
    <string name="health_atlas_home_glucagon_story_release_caption">α 细胞把储存的胰高血糖素释放到周围组织，随后进入附近的毛细血管。</string>
    <string name="health_atlas_home_glucagon_story_liver">信号随血液到达肝脏</string>
    <string name="health_atlas_home_glucagon_story_liver_caption">胰高血糖素随血液到达肝脏，在肝细胞的表面受体上发出信号；它本身不变成葡萄糖。</string>
    <string name="health_atlas_home_glucagon_story_glycogen">肝糖原被逐步分解</string>
    <string name="health_atlas_home_glucagon_story_glycogen_caption">受体信号促进肝糖原分解；细胞经过几步反应释放可进入血液的游离葡萄糖。肝脏也有其他产糖途径。</string>
    <string name="health_atlas_home_glucagon_story_export">葡萄糖由肝细胞进入血液</string>
    <string name="health_atlas_home_glucagon_story_export_caption">游离葡萄糖可通过转运蛋白离开肝细胞，进入血液，帮助维持全身的葡萄糖供应。</string>
    <string name="health_atlas_home_sweat_story_title">汗液如何帮助散热</string>
    <string name="health_atlas_home_sweat_story_scope">以小汗腺为例；画面比较相同初始汗量的蒸发，不估算体温、失水或补液量。</string>
    <string name="health_atlas_home_sweat_story_signal">神经信号到达汗腺</string>
    <string name="health_atlas_home_sweat_story_signal_caption">体温调节系统可通过交感神经向小汗腺发出信号，促使盘绕的腺体分泌汗液。</string>
    <string name="health_atlas_home_sweat_story_fluid">分泌部形成初始汗液</string>
    <string name="health_atlas_home_sweat_story_fluid_caption">盘绕的分泌部把盐和水送进管腔。形成的初始汗液沿汗管向皮肤表面移动。</string>
    <string name="health_atlas_home_sweat_story_salt">导管回收部分盐</string>
    <string name="health_atlas_home_sweat_story_salt_caption">初始汗液经过导管时，一部分钠和氯被重新吸收，剩余液体继续流向汗孔。</string>
    <string name="health_atlas_home_sweat_story_surface">汗液从汗孔到达表面</string>
    <string name="health_atlas_home_sweat_story_surface_caption">汗液穿过汗孔，在皮肤表面形成液滴或薄膜。液体留在皮肤上，还不等于发生蒸发散热。</string>
    <string name="health_atlas_home_sweat_story_evaporate">蒸发从皮肤带走热量</string>
    <string name="health_atlas_home_sweat_story_evaporate_caption">汗液蒸发时会从皮肤带走热量。其他条件相同时，潮湿空气通常使蒸发变慢，出汗多也不一定散热多。</string>
</resources>
